  "description": "I would like to replace the windows and balcony doors in both flats in this building and the common area - Flat A and Flat B, 107 Junction Rd - as the existing ones are deteriorating and in many instances rotting. The tenants have reported that the windows and balcony doors can be drafty and cold in the winter and water is ingressing through the bottom of the balcony doors due to their condition. I would like to replace them as \"like for like\" in terms of design and construction (ie. timber made) but replace the single glazing with double glazed to improve the energy performance rating and provide a warmer environment for the tenants.    ",
